            "detailed_description": "Steve, the Wizard has been kidnapping the Marshmallows!<br>Rally your troops and fight your way to the top of an ever-shuffling tower to defeat him!<br>Marshmallow Melee is an adorable rogue-lite dungeon crawler with toy-sized warriors. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/705100/extras/df3b7679d94b87b2896beee569a734f7.avif?t=1507273786\" width=600 height=105 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A toy-scaled dungeon crawler with over 70 unique “playset” levels<br></li><li> A Shuffling Tower System that creates a different adventure every time you play<br></li><li> Wacky weapons: hit enemies with a lolly-pop, cactus, and more!<br></li><li> Shops where you can buy powerful new weapons . . . and PIZZA!<br></li><li> Physically Based Rendering for ultimate Marshmallow immersion<br></li><li> Minimal Space Requirements: Designed for front-facing standing or seated VR (“Couch Scale”)</li></ul>",
